# Root of the Ruby class hierarchy -- has no superclass and an intentionally minimal API. Used as a base for proxy/builder objects that need to avoid inheriting Object/Kernel methods (e.g. method_missing delegators). Most code should inherit from Object instead.
class BasicObject
